# Copy to .env.local and fill in. EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are built into the app and are
# readable by anyone who has it: never put a key, token or other secret here. The app
# talks only to your own server's API; every secret stays on the server.

# Origin of your eMSP Starter server, for example https://emsp.example.com (or
# http://localhost:3000 in development). Leave empty to run the app in its own
# offline demo mode, with built-in sample data and no network requests.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
# Set to true (or 1, yes, on) to force the app's offline demo mode even when the URL is set.
EXPO_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE=

# The map. Empty: the app's own style on OpenFreeMap's free tiles (no key). Or your
# provider's style JSON URL; its key is public, so restrict it per platform (README).
# `none` draws no tiles at all.
EXPO_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL=
# Optional dark style, the attribution your provider requires, and the https page it
# links to (the provider's copyright page).
EXPO_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL_DARK=
EXPO_PUBLIC_MAP_ATTRIBUTION=
EXPO_PUBLIC_MAP_ATTRIBUTION_URL=
